      "behavior_append": "Rider tick speed reads MOVEMENT_SPEED, not ATTACK_DAMAGE.",
      "field_updates": {
        "vanilla_differences": "Tamable state base with health60 armor10 resistance1 range30 speed.1 knockback.5 native damage2 jumpStrength.9 XP10, configured full-health scaling/persistence. Rejects ON_FIRE/FALL/direct potion/cloud; FALL always rejected even though causeFallDamage separately suppresses reduceFallDamage and distance<60. Fluid pushes false, fluid effects true, water slow down .96; refreshes dimensions every baseTick. Native collision push to self disabled via canBePushedByEntity=false while pushable true. Commands0follow/1sit/2wander saved; owner shift interaction cycles commands on either side, leaving1 state0. Raw meat beef/mutton/pork/chicken/rabbit consumes via native usePlayerItem, tame probability1/3 with native cancel hook. Any player may ride already-tamed adult when command!=1 even if not owner; first LivingEntity passenger controls. Travel allowed only state0 and command!=1, rotates to rider with pitch*.5, strafe*.1 and forward unchanged; own tick also performs rider travel using full strafe and sets speed MOVEMENT_SPEED attribute+.1. Pending jump power clamped minimum0; >=90 scale1 else .4+.4*power/90, grounded rider tick executes Y=JUMP_STRENGTH*scale*blockFactor+jumpBoost, forward jump impulse(-.4*sinYaw*scale,0,.4*cosYaw*scale). LastJumpHeight initialized0 never updated; later lastY descent test <10 overrides earlier reduction flag, but all fall damage already rejected. While not ordered sit, server heals1 each tick%30 belowmax, regardless target/combat; sitting skips this branch. Roar cooldown decrements always; registered packet vehicle handlers start1/cooldown300 or random3/4 as separate network contract. State1 ticks6..19 flee nonallied PathfinderMob in16/10/16 box, excludes sitting tame, clears target/last attacker, grounded velocity horizontal*.7+jitter+/-.05, navigation away(15,7) speed2; no Fear status application. State3 tick16 area5/height3/arc180/base10/shield40/launch; state4 ticks12/37 area2/height3/arc360/base7/shield40/no launch, rings6/11/14 at radius2.5/3.5/4.5 ticks12/13/16 and37/40/43, ground-supported Shockwave owner=this damage4 warmup0/false, no local server gate. Area amount*SkeloraptorDamageMultiplier, excludes self/allies only; launch independent accepted hit, horizontal1.2 divided squared distance floor1e-4/Y.5; stun/knockback arguments ignored. AI attacks states4/3/1 sample16/35 range4 max55/50/53, require no controller and command!=1, roar-ready and stop300; state goals1/4/3 clocks53/55/50 freeze horizontal,7 recovery20,5->6 sit25,6 sitloop80. Native follow4 distances10/2 suppressed1/2; other walking goals plus retaliation. Server horizontal collision/mobGriefing destroys Leaves in box inflated2 with drops. Uncalled legacy area3/height3 native doHurtTarget adds no active attack. No offspring, standard native death. Presentation tables/camera do not add damage. Rider tick speed reads MOVEMENT_SPEED."
      },
